WEBVTT

00:00:00.119 --> 00:00:05.183
This video shows how to assign students to a transport route on a phone.

00:00:06.857 --> 00:00:13.241
Tap the menu button, open Transport and choose Assignments. Tap New Assignment.

00:00:27.246 --> 00:00:38.910
Search for a student and tap the name. Search Fatima and tap Fatima Noor, then search Sara and tap Sara Khan. The window counts 2 students selected.

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:54.878
Choose the route, Route A - North Sector, then the stop, Model Town. The vehicle is optional, and we choose the bus.

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:08.274
Tap Assign 2 Students. Both students now appear in the list with their stop and times.

00:01:24.934 --> 00:01:29.638
Both students are on the route and ready for daily transport attendance.
